handwritten-notes-error-read-failed = The PDF could not be read.
handwritten-notes-error-encrypted = Encrypted PDFs are not supported.
handwritten-notes-error-unsupported = This PDF's structure is not supported, so no page was added. The file was not modified.
handwritten-notes-error-generate-failed = Failed to generate the PDF. The file was not modified.
